{title: She'll Be Coming 'Round the Mountain}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: G}
{tempo: 120}
{difficulty: beginner}
{tags: folk, kids}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
She'll be [G]coming 'round the mountain when she [D]comes
She'll be coming 'round the mountain when she [G]comes
She'll be [G7]coming 'round the mountain, she'll be [C]coming 'round the mountain
She'll be [G]coming 'round the mountain when she [D]comes[G]

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
She'll be [G]driving six white horses when she [D]comes
She'll be driving six white horses when she [G]comes
She'll be [G7]driving six white horses, she'll be [C]driving six white horses
She'll be [G]driving six white horses when she [D]comes[G]

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Oh, we'll [G]all go out to meet her when she [D]comes
Oh, we'll all go out to meet her when she [G]comes
Oh, we'll [G7]all go out to meet her, oh, we'll [C]all go out to meet her
Oh, we'll [G]all go out to meet her when she [D]comes[G]
